<%# locals: (pane:) %>
<%#
  The review layout: the block's sections of lines on the left, the pane on the
  right from lg up and under the selected line below it.

  The pane holds its own turbo frame (uf-pane, in _review_pane) that advances
  the URL, and each line is a link into that frame, so selecting a line fetches
  and swaps only the pane: the list, and the link the reader just activated,
  stay where they are. review_pane_controller keeps the list in step with whom
  the pane shows, parks the pane under that line below lg, and brings the line
  into view on a full load or a Back restore.
%>
<div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-4" data-controller="review-pane">
  <div class="lg:w-2/5 lg:shrink-0">
    <%= yield %>
  </div>
  <%= pane %>
</div>
